@deedydas Wrote some notes on how to actually run the model (assuming you want a high volume prod API)

If you have B200 + the model survives FP4 quant (likely given size), just grab a node, Dynamo, and let it rip.

But you'll probably need Hopper for scale which means multinode + EP. https://t.co/bm6hgDZNvn

